  "body": "Hmmm... I'm not sure I'd call it standard. I have 134 other portable apps and none of them are blocked. Many are from what appear to be individual developers and I'm guessing not every exe is signed.\n\nThe only other app that triggers this message is Steam which I'm guessing actually is signed. However, after the message is triggered, the program runs fine so whatever is being blocked must not be critical to execution unlike with ART.",
